# RS-MobStand

RS-MobStand is a Minecraft server plugin that provides automated mob farming through configurable Mob Stands.

Part of the RS ecosystem developed by RSScripting.

## Features

- Automated mob drop generation
- Adult and Baby mob filters
- Radius controls
- Leave Alive options
- Conversion support
- Dynamic GUI menus
- SQLite data storage
- Chunk-safe operation
- Admin tools
- Performance-focused design

## Commands

| Command | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| /rsms | Opens the Mob Stand menu |
| /rsms admin | Opens the admin menu |

## Permissions

| Permission | Description |
|------------|-------------|
| rs.mobstand.use | Allows use of Mob Stands |
| rs.mobstand.admin | Administrative access |

## RS Ecosystem

- RS-MobStand - Resource generation
- RS-ItemMagnet - Item collection and routing
- RS-Auger - Vertical item transport
- RS-Warehouse - Large-scale storage

